              <mxCell id="implDefer" value="&lt;b&gt;validation-deferred is not PASS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A skipped or cancelled &lt;i&gt;required&lt;/i&gt; check permits continued development of dependency-ready work, blocks /kapelle:verify --approve, and is picked up first by a later &lt;b&gt;/kapelle:implement --validation=allow&lt;/b&gt; run — which executes the outstanding checks without repeating the implementation. Recorded as passed | failed | skipped | cancelled per dispatcher/validation-decision.schema.json." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1130" width="1620" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
